Tamanna AI Workflow Hardening Checklist

1. auto-upgrade.yml
   - contents: read
   - pull-requests: read
   - Remove automatic source rewriting and automatic PR creation.
   - Do not send repository source to an external AI service without approval.

2. auto-sync-bd-king-r7.yml
   - Remove contents: write.
   - Remove automatic git add/commit/push.
   - Keep build and validation steps read-only.

3. ai-debug.yml
   - Set TAMANNA_ANALYZER_REPORT explicitly.
   - Set TAMANNA_FIXER_REPORT explicitly.
   - Upload the exact paths those scripts actually create.
   - Do not ignore missing reports silently.

4. tamanna-ai-altimate.yml
   - Pass github.event.comment.body through env: COMMENT.
   - Do not interpolate comment text into a shell command.
   - Use an exact command allowlist.
   - Keep deployment and destructive actions behind explicit approval.

5. security-checks.yml
   - Pin third-party actions to reviewed immutable commit SHAs.
   - Do not use || true for mandatory security checks.
   - Upload reports even on failure.
   - Do not publish secret values in logs.
